## 🎨 Design System

### Couleurs CAPOSA

```css
/* Vert principal */
--caposa-green: #2E7D32;
--caposa-green-dark: #1B5E20;

/* Bleu pétrole */
--caposa-blue: #355C7D;
--caposa-blue-dark: #2A4A5E;

/* Or doux */
--caposa-gold: #D4AF37;
--caposa-gold-light: #C9B27C;

/* Vert sauge */
--caposa-sage: #DDEAD5;

/* Neutrals */
--caposa-ivory: #F9F9F6;
--caposa-gray: #6E6E6E;
```

### Gradients utilisés

```css
/* Vert principal */
bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2E7D32] to-[#1B5E20]

/* Bleu pétrole */
bg-gradient-to-br from-[#355C7D] to-[#2A4A5E]

/* Vert sauge */
bg-gradient-to-br from-[#81C784] to-[#66BB6A]

/* Or doux */
bg-gradient-to-br from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C9B27C]
```

